								kind: "troparion",
								text: "<p>As thou didst share in the ways of the apostles * and didst occupy their throne, * thou didst find thine activity to be a passage to divine vision, * O divinely inspired one. * Wherefore, ordering the word of truth, * thou didst suffer for the Faith even to the shedding of thy blood. ** O hieromartyr Dorotheas, entreat Christ God, that our souls be saved.</p>",
								type: "1",
