								text: "<p>Resplendent with virtues brighter than the sun * and with thy sufferings, O blessed Dorotheus, * thou didst shine forth and illumine the land, * dispelling the darkness of polytheism and vile heresy. * Wherefore, we celebrate thy memory with splendor.</p>",
